# THE CERTIFICATE AND ITS PRIVATE KEY GO HERE, ON THE HOST, PLACED BY THE OWNER.
#
#   fullchain.pem   the certificate and its chain
#   privkey.pem     the private key, mode 600
#
# NOTHING IN THIS DIRECTORY IS EVER COMMITTED. The two lines below ignore every file in it
# except this one, so `git status` cannot tempt anybody and `git add -A` cannot take a key
# by accident. `tests/integration/composition/test_proxy_tls_path.py` asks
# `git check-ignore` about both names rather than trusting this comment.
#
# THE DIRECTORY ITSELF IS TRACKED -- that is what this file is for. `D-37`: a `-v` source
# the daemon cannot resolve becomes an INVENTED EMPTY DIRECTORY, not a refusal, so a clean
# clone that already contains this directory is one fewer way for the mount to be a
# surprise.
*
!.gitignore
